5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,800
I'm not interested in babysitting a couple of noobs.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,680
Hey! What did you just call me?

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,820
We're both still working hard to level up.

8
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,140
Once we get stronger, we can help you out.

9
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:19,320
And yet you couldn't even tell that Father Zombie was undead.

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,740
That's like basic awareness.

11
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,800
You guys are pretty useless.

12
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:26,220
I don't need dead weight tagging along.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,640
Then I'd better show you what I'm made of!

14
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:32,280
They call me Mosh the Hero back in my hometown of Nakashi!

15
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,200
Whatevs. Sounds like a crock-o-she.

16
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,680
That's Nakashi, jerk!

17
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,360
That's it, I'm not going to be you!

18
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,600
Hey, what's going on over here?

19
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,760
Who would dare to desecrate this holy church into ruin?

20
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,240
No, sister, are you hurt?

21
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,020
You, explain yourselves.

22
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,120
If I sense deception, I'll haul you in for interrogation.

23
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,200
This is a misunderstanding. I can tell you how it all broke down.

24
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,280
Oh, wait, too soon?

25
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:57,660
The truth is, there was a horrible creature that disguised itself as a priest.

26
00:00:57,660 --> 00:01:00,500
Were they responsible for the sinful misdeed?

27
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:03,700
I'm still rather shaken, so the exact details are vague.

28
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,720
But yes, I'm positive it was that undead brute who destroyed the chapel.

29
00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:14,500
One thing I do remember clearly, it said 10,000 more of its ungodly ilk would come to join it.

30
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:14,940
10,000?

31
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:17,220
Already overtaken Crane Castle heading south.

32
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,940
Who could have imagined such numbers?

33
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,540
Hold fast to your faith, sir.

34
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,480
You see, God has not forsaken us yet.

35
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,460
Don't you worry.

36
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:27,880
After all, the heavens have sent us a divine goddess,

37
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,480
as well as a blessed hero with great strength,

38
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:33,260
and two allies with dragonkin blood in their veins.

39
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:36,300
Please forgive my rudeness.

40
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,320
Let's start over.

41
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:40,200
We're knights of the Empire, sent to defend Seymour,

42
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:42,080
