43
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:45,360
Sir Hero, we humbly request that you fight alongside us.

44
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,500
How much you got?

45
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,260
How much? Of what?

46
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,880
Duh, how much money.

47
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:52,100
Hold on, Seiya.

48
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:53,860
You think now is the best time for this?

49
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:54,480
Pipe down.

50
00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:56,180
I learned a new move recently.

51
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:59,200
It's one that requires a fairly hefty amount of capital.

52
00:01:59,520 --> 00:01:59,920
Capital?

53
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:02,280
What kind of scammy technique are we talking here?

54
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,960
Of course.

55
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:05,000
You'll be compensated with a handsome reward.

56
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,120
At least a thousand gold coins.

57
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:07,480
Cool, bro.

58
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,960
I'll just need that in writing.

59
00:02:09,820 --> 00:02:10,640
One moment.

60
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,480
There's 200 knights on their way here.

61
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:14,860
Don't you want our help?

62
00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:15,780
We're the Imperial-

63
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:16,100
Hard pass.

64
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:17,880
What do you mean, hard pass?

65
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:20,840
I'll bet this town has a few stragglers lurking around.

66
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,920
You guys should stay here and protect them.

67
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:26,540
Yo, are you paying attention, mashed potato?

68
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,500
Hey, my name is Mosh the Hero.

69
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,060
Stop mispronouncing everything!

70
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,700
If you're not going back to Krakoshi,

71
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,880
then help out the knights.

72
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,580
Or whatever isn't around me.

73
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,020
Well, what do we do now?

74
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:36,420
Ha!

75
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,860
Definitely not whatever that jerk says!

76
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:39,840
Huh?

77
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,380
Where are you going?

78
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:44,180
Slow down!

79
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:45,220
Guys, don't go!

80
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:46,040
