81
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:46,640
Hey, Lulu!

82
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:47,840
Oh, boy.

83
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,400
I hope they aren't planning to bum-rush a horde of brain-eaters.

84
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,080
I doubt they're that stupid.

85
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,420
But even so, I'll have wiped out those dead gas bags first.

86
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:58,260
Okay, so you may be ridiculously strong,

87
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,340
but seriously,

88
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,280
