89
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,020
No way.

90
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,180
That's dumb.

91
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:06,460
Oh, excuse me for thinking a little teamwork might be a good idea.

92
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,160
There are 10,000 zombies.

93
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,980
Having another one or 200 people with us is pointless.

94
