Wait, is this a dream?

112
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:40,820
Hard pass!

113
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:43,720
That lousy, ungrateful, selfish, glory-hugging meathead!

114
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,300
You're done-zo!

115
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,220
Ooh!

116
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:48,140
I'm gonna hard pass you!

117
