258
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:11,560
A strange man wearing a hood brought it over.

259
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:15,280
He said something about wanting to give that meathead hero a gift.

260
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:17,440
That sounds fishy.

261
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,660
Could be an explosive.

262
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,320
You open it.

263
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:23,500
Just because I can't die doesn't mean you can explosive boss me.

264
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,500
Oh my.

265
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:29,740
That's that sexy little vixen.

266
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,720
I don't like it anymore!

267
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:46,380
No, this is bad!

268
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,640
Ash is in trouble!

269
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:50,380
Hello.

270
00:10:50,780 --> 00:10:51,660
Can you see me?

271
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,760
Do you hear the sound of my voice?

272
00:10:54,620 --> 00:10:57,460
Well, I can see you all perfectly from here.

273
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:03,640
I spy a strappingly handsome hero, a beautiful goddess in white, and an adorable young red-haired girl.

274
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:06,820
A peculiar mirror, is it not?

275
00:11:06,820 --> 00:11:10,820
It can reveal images from far away through the magic of the demon lord.

276
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:14,000
Oh, I've yet to introduce myself.

277
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
My name is Death Magma.

278
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:20,240
I'm one of the four heavenly kings, and my unique specialty is necromancy, of course.

279
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,160
Oh, that's the undead general?

280
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:24,740
Well, what kind of general doesn't march with his army?

281
00:11:25,420 --> 00:11:29,660
I must admit, I didn't expect you to dispatch my minions so easily.

282
00:11:30,300 --> 00:11:32,560
Luckily, I was able to command them remotely.

283
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:38,640
Speaking of that, do you know how long it takes to build a legion of undead soldiers?

284
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:42,460
Obviously, I thought I'd offset my losses with revenge.

285
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:45,220
With this weak, milk-smelling boy.

286
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:46,700
No, stop it!

287
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,940
Leave him alone!

288
00:11:48,740 --> 00:11:53,020
Working with corpses is tedious, but playing with a life is so much fun.

289
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:56,000
And when that gets boring, there's always murder.

290
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,740
No, don't touch him!

291
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:58,240
Please!

292
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,100
That's enough, you monster!

293
00:12:00,100 --> 00:12:04,140
Oh my, I'm begging for your life at the end.

294
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,880
Go right ahead and cry as much as you'd like.

295
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:12,280
Hey, Hiro, I heard you took out all 10,000 of those zombies.

296
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:17,200
You're a big meathead that's full of himself, but you're the real deal.

297
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:19,700
You're just different, you know?

298
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:24,120
So please, no matter what happens, you've got to save the world.

299
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:25,660
That poor boy.

300
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:29,080
Come on, that didn't sound like crying at all!

301
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:34,020
Fortunately, we won't have to endure any of your baby-blathering for much longer.

302
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,360
Somebody do something!

303
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,480
I'm begging you to save him, please!

304
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,540
Beg all you want!

305
00:12:40,980 --> 00:12:42,620
Your hero can't save him.

306
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:46,200
All you can do is watch as I slice through his neck.

307
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:49,620
Rista, open a portal to the Divine Realm.

308
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:54,580
But, even if time is faster there compared to Gaya Brande, what could we possibly do?

309
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:55,560
Just open it, now.

310
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:57,000
If you say so.

311
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:00,720
I have to say, Mosh, you don't totally suck.

312
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:04,300
Once we get you out of there, I'm gonna let you carry my gear for me.

313
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:05,060
Ah!

314
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:07,740
You see, I've already been here before.

315
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,880
Since then, I've been running simulations again and again.

316
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,560
What if I had less time?

317
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:16,040
What would I do then?

318
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:16,920
Ha!

319
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:20,180
Do you not understand we aren't even in the same room?

320
00:13:20,340 --> 00:13:21,620
You stupid meathead!

321
00:13:21,820 --> 00:13:23,280
You can't touch me!

322
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,120
Stop it!

323
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,440
Stop it!

324
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:28,240
Hm.

325
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:29,700
Ah!

326
00:13:30,860 --> 00:13:31,380
No!

327
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,360
But how?

328
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:36,200
Photon swords can cut the fabric of space, bro.

329
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,100
Meet my dimension blade.

330
00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:40,780
According to what laws that thing is excessive?

331
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:44,880
Hurry up.

332
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:46,580
The real battle's just begun.

333
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:47,360
Huh?

334
00:13:47,540 --> 00:13:48,480
Care to explain?

335
00:13:48,780 --> 00:13:50,620
We managed to confuse him momentarily.

336
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:52,960
But once he loses it, he's gonna kill Mosh.

337
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:54,180
Right.

338
00:13:54,340 --> 00:13:55,180
So what's the plan?

339
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:59,060
As you know, time flows much faster in the Divine Realm than it does back there.

340
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:03,780
It won't take Triclops more than 10 seconds to find a weapon and shank Dragon Boy with it.

341
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:10,520
Therefore, we have less than 15 minutes to figure out how to get to them first and rescue our guy.

342
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:12,740
Okay, I think I got it.

343
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:16,680
I might know someone who can help, but let me lead.

344
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,460
You just need to stay quiet.

345
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:20,980
Granny, are you the head goddess around here?

346
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:21,760
Hey!

347
00:14:21,940 --> 00:14:23,400
Didn't I tell you to shut your mouth?

348
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,400
Sorry, Ishtar.

349
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:24,980
So sorry.

350
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:25,800
I really mean it.

351
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:28,240
I'm looking for shrooms on Gaya Brandy, and it's urgent.

352
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:29,400
Bust out a portal.

353
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:32,080
That is not how you speak to a great goddess!

354
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,800
And no more fungus puns!

355
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:34,660
His name is Mosh!

356
00:14:34,660 --> 00:14:39,280
So, in other words, you're saying you'd like me to help you find your companion.

357
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:44,360
But Divine Law forbids goddesses from granting any excessive support to humankind.

358
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:49,700
All you'd be doing is making a hole, adorn a specific spot like this chick does all the time.

359
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,780
Tot's no big.

360
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,920
True, true.

361
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:55,620
I do believe you might just have a point there.

362
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,140
Very well, then.

363
00:14:57,140 --> 00:15:02,120
Ah, there it is.

364
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:04,220
They're in the forest near Crane Castle.

365
00:15:04,580 --> 00:15:06,940
Your friend is being held captive in a vast dungeon.

366
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:09,200
Thanks, you're always incredible, Ishtar.

367
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:10,000
Good.

368
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,280
Now drop us in.

369
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:12,980
Right in front of the mashed potato.

370
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:14,060
Okay.

371
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,840
Great, now we're doing potatoes.

372
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,160
Thank you for helping us.

373
00:15:19,260 --> 00:15:20,580
We'd be lost without your aid.

374
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:21,880
Come on, say something!

375
00:15:22,140 --> 00:15:23,000
Hey, good job.

376
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:23,960
Thanks, Meemaw.

377
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,620
Can you not be smug for five seconds?

378
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:26,100
Ah!

379
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:27,800
Do you even know what you're walking us into?

380
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,620
Duh, what do you take me for?

381
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:33,540
As soon as we exit the portal, I'm hitting him with Hell's Fire.

382
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:36,980
While he's distracted, you can use the moment to scoop up Mosh.

383
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,180
Let's go.

384
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,640
Ah, voucher that.

385
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:46,380
It's impressive how much you've grown, Mr. Seiya Ryuguin.

386
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:48,280
I bid you good hunting.

387
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,480
Ah, it hurts!

388
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:51,740
My hand!

389
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,800
But how?

390
00:15:52,800 --> 00:16:00,440
Miss me?

391
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:01,500
Hell's Fire!

392
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:06,920
Hey, it's Rista.

393
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:07,660
You okay?

394
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:09,340
I think so.

395
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,580
Oh, how heartless.

396
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:14,000
Let's get you patched up.

397
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:19,560
How's he doing?

398
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:25,620
Black flames.

399
00:16:26,180 --> 00:16:28,120
It looks like the fire is protecting him.

400
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,960
What kind of monster is that?

401
00:16:38,260 --> 00:16:38,900
It's...

402
00:16:38,900 --> 00:16:39,400
It's a...

403
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:44,240
Is that all it took to take down Chaos Machina?

404
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:46,420
Because it won't work on this Heavenly King.

405
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:48,040
Your weakness is insulting!

406
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:53,200
Is that a ghost monster?

407
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:56,940
I already tried that stuff.

408
00:16:56,940 --> 00:16:58,000
It didn't work.

409
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:58,620
Well, right.

410
00:16:58,740 --> 00:16:59,880
I bet that was your first move.

411
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:00,520
Hold up.

412
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:01,700
So it's not a ghost?

413
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:04,160
This one's name is Dark Virus.

414
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:08,820
The mightiest, fiercest creature I've ever created out of my hundreds of experiments.

415
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,300
A fire type?

416
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:12,240
I thought you only created the undead!

417
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:18,260
Modifying all manner of monsters just so happens to be my special skill, you basic symbol, then!

418
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,860
Who you call a basic?

419
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:21,460
We need to exploit his weaknesses!

420
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:25,140
Defense is over a hundred thousand?

421
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:27,260
He's immune to all weapon attacks?

422
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,140
Only weak against ice magic.

423
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,840
Yes, you blunt idiot.

424
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:37,360
You fight it by disrupting its molecular structure with the oscillatory wave skill.

425
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:44,380
Cold attacks will convert its affiliation from fire to ice, making its ghostly body materialize.

426
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:50,240
If you can hit Dark Virus with a power that's greater than its defense, only then can you defeat it.

427
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,300
Huh.

428
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:53,540
Thanks for the boss walkthrough, Pops.

429
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:55,360
Hold on.

430
00:17:56,180 --> 00:18:01,960
Oscillatory wave is a melee-only technique, and ice spells are the complete opposite of Seiya's fire magic.

431
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:03,740
There's no way to beat him!

432
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:07,640
I fed you bits of hope so I could savor every moment of your despair.

433
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:15,000
I have hypothesized every contingency and planned accordingly, for that's the genius of a true tactician.

434
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,100
Is this really happening?

435
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:19,460
Pretty much!

436
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:20,880
How surprising.

437
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:22,740
I'm kind of shocked, honestly.

438
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:27,540
You say you've done a lot of hypothesizing and planning?

439
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:28,240
Nah.

440
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:31,340
You act so pretentious, but I can read you like an open book.

441
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:35,700
Are you implying you've somehow anticipated this exact situation?

442
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:40,220
I'm implying you're a huge tool and you've already lost and don't know it.

443
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:43,580
Nice talk, Sugar Lips, but you won't defeat him.

444
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:47,840
He's invincible, and you're a sad excuse for an unprepared hero.

445
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,420
That's not my style.

446
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:56,020
I am perfectly prepared.

447
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:58,800
I'm 100% ready for this fight.

448
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:03,400
I'm ready to wipe that smug look off your dumb emo face!

449
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,700
I'm ready to go!

450
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:07,700
I'm ready to go!

451
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,700
I'm ready to go!

452
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:09,700
I'm ready to go!

453
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:10,700
I'm ready to go!

454
00:19:10,700 --> 00:19:11,700
I'm ready to go!

455
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:12,700
I'm ready to go!

456
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:13,700
I'm ready to go!

457
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:14,700
I'm ready to go!

458
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:15,700
Wait, what?

459
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:16,700
Behold, a fire that won't burn out until it consumes you!

460
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:17,700
Dodge if you wish, but everyone behind you will perish instead!

461
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:18,700
Ugh, that means us!

462
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:19,700
Don't need to dodge you.

463
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:20,700
Go ahead and do your worst.

464
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:24,700
You still dare to attack me?

465
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:25,700
Duh!

466
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:35,360
That's impossible! You're a swordsman! How do you have a melee skill?

467
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:41,180
I don't believe in limiting myself. If I couldn't use my blade, then I'd have to use my fists.

468
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:47,420
Some enemies are resistant to sword attacks, and there's no telling when it might break during combat.

469
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:53,280
What if it got stolen by my opponents? Or what if it got rusted, or dissolved, or got eaten by moths?

470
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:56,080
It's a good thing I learned hand-to-hand combat.

471
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:58,400
Okay, that is unbelievably cautious.

472
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:05,120
Doesn't matter! Because you're still no match for Dark Virus and his burning fists of fiery death!

473
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:12,000
You think you can counter with your puny human hands? Your whole arm will explode!

474
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:21,360
Wait, what is happening? Fire and ice magic are incompatible! There's no way you should be able to use both!

475
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:24,240
That amulet!

476
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:26,960
An item that grabs the properties of ice?!

477
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:32,240
That's it! Even if he can't produce it on his own, he can achieve the same effect!

478
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:34,480
Wait, where did he find something like that to begin with?

479
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,480
Synthesis! You made that bracelet yourself!

480
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:38,800
Yeah.

481
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:42,720
Nice! But what did you synthesize to make that?

482
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:47,120
I just used an ordinary bangle, a few ice cubes, and your hair.

483
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,400
Yeah, your hair made it work.

484
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,440
Huh?

485
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,200
Oh, there's more where that came from.

486
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:52,560
Huh?

487
00:20:52,560 --> 00:20:57,680
Some for lightning, some for light, some for dark, and of course the list goes on. I made spares too.

488
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:01,200
And yes, all of them synthesized from hairs that were scattered around your bedroom.

489
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:04,640
That's a lot of hair! Oh my gosh, I'm not going bald, am I?

490
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:11,040
Only his body materialized! You and your stupid hair still can't overcome Dark Virus' defenses!

491
00:21:11,040 --> 00:21:14,000
You're right. Unfortunately, I don't. But it's no problem.

492
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:17,600
You know what's effective against a vulnerable, glistening body of ice?

493
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:19,680
A flame attack.

494
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:24,400
Oh, they didn't think of that! Dark Virus, close in and stop his attack!

495
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:25,280
It's too late.

496
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:33,280
A white-hot fixed-point strike. Phoenix thrust!

497
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:43,280
Thrustin' it!

498
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:47,520
Is he for real? He just demolished that behemoth like it was nothing.

499
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:51,600
Eat it, sucker! That's a one in a hundred million phenomenon over there!

500
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:53,920
No, no, no! There's no way!

501
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:57,280
That's what you get for monologuing yourself, you loser!

502
00:21:57,280 --> 00:22:01,680
Well, if he hadn't told us how to win, I'm sure I would have found out soon enough.

503
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:05,920
Yeah, I believe you, because you're the smartest and strongest hero ever!

504
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:09,120
Now then, it's time for me to finish taking out the trash.

505
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:16,400
After that, this room needs a deep clean.

506
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:23,840
You go right ahead! Take all the time you need, okay?

507
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:28,320
Ah!

508
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:44,800
教えて!

509
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:48,240
心の在り方ステータスを

510
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:51,120
強さも不器用さも

511
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:54,640
君は特別すぎたよ

512
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:56,400
魔法だって

513
00:22:56,400 --> 00:23:00,400
解けない謎の横顔で

514
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:06,400
見つめた明日はぐれ星を巡るの

515
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:09,400
何度目サプライジング

516
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:12,300
嫌だねどこ行くの

517
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:16,340
ここではぐれたらノーマレーン

518
00:23:16,340 --> 00:23:22,400
離さないであなたへお願いは一個だけ

519
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:26,400
Be Perfect Please Be Perfect Please

520
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:29,400
未来はきっと繋いだ糸

521
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:33,400
遠く細いけど輝いは絆

522
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:36,400
確かめた追いつけない

523
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:37,400
オラバラスライン

524
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:40,400
刻んでそっと痛いな一歩

525
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:43,400
愛想のない大きな手のひら

526
